From: MakOS Project <makos@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] config: wrap sys/random.h with default visibility

Firefox compiles source files under gcc_hidden.h.  System declarations must
pass through generated wrappers so imports from shared libc retain default
visibility.  NSPR's MakOS entropy backend includes sys/random.h; without this
entry getrandom becomes a hidden undefined symbol and libnspr4.so cannot link.

diff --git a/config/system-headers.mozbuild b/config/system-headers.mozbuild
--- a/config/system-headers.mozbuild
+++ b/config/system-headers.mozbuild
@@ -855,5 +855,6 @@ system_headers = [
     "sys/queue.h",
     "sys/quota.h",
+    "sys/random.h",
     "sys/reboot.h",
     "sys/reg.h",
     "sys/regset.h",
